                                "sense_id": "49f9b86f-440c-37fe-8e0e-f457c8f0577b",
                                "text": "\"Leave me alone for once,\" she said angrily."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33596daf-62d6-4bb7-8d6c-8cd792685c84",
                                "sense_id": "49f9b86f-440c-37fe-8e0e-f457c8f0577b",
                                "text": "\"So it was a trick,\" said Narkunda angrily."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a0bdc06-3f0b-40f7-b3b6-fe82c6f69fac",
                                "sense_id": "49f9b86f-440c-37fe-8e0e-f457c8f0577b",
                                "text": "The message from this week’s election – and from the angry, at times overtly sexist and authoritarian rhetoric that Mr. Trump used on the campaign trail – is that America is a deeply, angrily, unstably divided country."
                            }
                        ]
